OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ANational museums to stay free for all
OL,4,Avisitors
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut the Department for Digital,
OL,7,FCulture, Media and Sport (DCMS) has now
OL,8,Fsaid this could deter domestic visitors
OL,9,Fand that any benefits of charging would
OL,10,Fnot be felt equally across the sector.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
